msgctxt "192"
msgid ""
"Oh, well ain't this a wild surprise! What're ya doin' all\r\n"
"the way out here?"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "204"
msgid ""
"I should be asking you. Weren't you supposed to be in\r\n"
"Kyushu?"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "216"
msgid ""
"Well sure, I was for a while. Walked all over Fukuoka,\r\n"
"Kumamoto, and Kagoshima tryin' out different ramen joints.\r\n"
"Then I heard that Okinawa's got some fine-tastin' pork!"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "228"
msgid ""
"So, to make a long story short, I ended up over here, on a quest to find the"
" best Okinawan soba! Ya wouldn't happen to have any clues for me, now would "
"ya?"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "240"
msgid ""
"Actually, there's a pretty good Okinawan soba stand over in Kariyushi "
"Arcade. Why don't you try it out?"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "252"
msgid "As a matter of fact, I think I will! Thanks a lot, big guy!"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "312"
msgid ""
"(He came all the way to Okinawa just to research noodles... This guy's a bit"
" of a noodle himself.)"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "324"
msgid ""
"I'm sure you won't have any trouble finding one on your own. After all, you "
"got this far, right?"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "336"
msgid ""
"I dunno, I've tried a lot of places already... None of 'em really did "
"anything for me."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "348"
msgid "Well, guess it couldn't hurt to look around some more."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "360"
msgid "Still can't find it?"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "372"
msgid "Well, I've been looking all over the place, but no dice."
msgstr ""

